The web panels in necto-core/src/main/panels are copied from Necto's
Sources/NectoDefaultPlugins/Panels. The manifests of the preferences and control
panels were adjusted for Android wording; the panel code is unchanged.

The plugin-sample panel in sample/src/main/resources/panels/plugin-sample is copied
unchanged from Necto's WebPackages/BuiltInPlugins/Plugins/plugin-sample (0.2.0).
